agraph","text":"昨年の第一章から一年経ちましたが、今年もまた帝一の國に帰ってこれてよかったです。\n少しでも成長できたかなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私にとっては、今日のソワレが東京千秋楽となります。\nもう最後だなんて...なんだか寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと2公演がんばるぞー！おー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、帝一の國ブログのほうにも\nお当番が来たので見てね♪\n▼ http://yaplog.jp/teiichi/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、休む暇なく\n夏の全国ツアーに向けての動きも、\n着々と進んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また色々と、並行しての日々が続いています。\n忙しいのはとても有難いです。\nいつもよりボーッとしてしまうけど。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!5   見て下さった方、\n有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんには、お話を振りたいなーと思ってたのです。笑\n心許せるひめたんにだからできる、氷対応"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐いてる人に\nちょっかい出すの好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見せかけ天使...(   ˙-˙   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃん、お誕生日おめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私のもお母さんも\n16日がお誕生日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親孝行..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-34927":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが、\n昨日10/9は何の日だったでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の飼っている愛犬\n\"さくら\"の11歳のお誕生日！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/11/1220565/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも側にいてくれて\nありがとう、さくちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくちゃんは本当に賢くて、\nいい子で、人懐っこくて、\nふと気づいたら隣に寝てる、\n世界で一番可愛い犬です(ˆ ˆ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(犬バカ)(親バカ？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が泣いていると知らぬ間にさくらは\n隣にいて様子を伺ってきて\n涙を舐めて慰めてくれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心優しくて一人の時も寂しくありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくちゃんが居てくれて良かったと\n思うところばかりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうおばあちゃん。。\n出来るだけさくちゃんの側にいたいし\n元気な姿をずっと見ていたいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしておめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は父のアメリカンフットボールの\n試合を観に行ってきました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/11/1220565/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近中々都合が合わず行けてなかったので\n久しぶりの応援でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果的には負けてしまいましたが\n父がプレーしているところを\n久々に見る事ができて嬉しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20代のプレイヤーに混ざって\n頑張っていました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな姿に元気ももらえました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もまだまだひよっこだな〜\n頑張らなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/11/1220565/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてやっぱり観戦、応援は\nとても楽しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スポーツ観戦趣味です(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「希望の歌」ウルトラタワーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもキャッチーな曲調、\n高く綺麗な歌声、\nそして素敵な歌詞。\n何度でも聞きたくなる曲です。\n好きな歌詞がありすぎて\n1つに絞りたくないんだけど\nラストの、\n\"生まれ変わる 何度でも\n仰いでいた 空越えていく\n握りしめた掌のその中に希望があったんだ\"\nは好きな空が入っていたり\n前向きで諦めない気持ちが伝わってきて\n頑張ろうっていう気持ちになります。\n本当に歌詞がいいので聞いて欲しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/10/11/1220565/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もChihAnswer募集します！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三連休、皆さんどうお過ごしましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この三連休で一気に秋が深まった気が...( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋の味覚食べなきゃね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}}